{"id":823,"date":"2026-08-08T00:31:15","date_gmt":"2026-08-08T00:31:15","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.emersonrush.com\/es\/?p=823"},"modified":"2026-08-08T02:05:26","modified_gmt":"2026-08-08T02:05:26","slug":"6-razones-estrategicas-para-contratar-un-consultor-sap-en-una-pyme","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.emersonrush.com\/es\/2026\/08\/08\/6-razones-estrategicas-para-contratar-un-consultor-sap-en-una-pyme\/","title":{"rendered":"6 Razones Estrat\u00e9gicas para Contratar un Consultor SAP en una PyME"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"823\" class=\"elementor elementor-823\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-e34cb1d elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"e34cb1d\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-fde2a8b\" data-id=\"fde2a8b\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-35061f0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"35061f0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Durante muchos a\u00f1os se consider\u00f3 que SAP era una soluci\u00f3n exclusiva para grandes corporativos. Sin embargo, la evoluci\u00f3n de la plataforma ha permitido que peque\u00f1as y medianas empresas incorporen este ERP para optimizar procesos, mejorar la toma de decisiones y fortalecer su crecimiento.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">No obstante, implementar o aprovechar SAP de manera eficiente requiere experiencia t\u00e9cnica y conocimiento de los procesos del negocio. En este escenario, contar con un <\/span><b>consultor SAP<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> representa una ventaja estrat\u00e9gica para que la empresa reduzca riesgos, acelere la adopci\u00f3n del sistema y obtenga un mayor retorno de su inversi\u00f3n.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">En este art\u00edculo conocer\u00e1 por qu\u00e9 una PyME tambi\u00e9n puede beneficiarse de la consultor\u00eda especializada y qu\u00e9 aspectos debe considerar al seleccionar un aliado para su proyecto.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-bb3350c elementor-section-height-min-height elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-items-middle\" data-id=\"bb3350c\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-wide\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-ea34888\" data-id=\"ea34888\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1829be9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1829be9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\"><b>1. Adaptar SAP a las necesidades reales de la empresa<\/b><\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-f9a4a52\" data-id=\"f9a4a52\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2cd65a8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2cd65a8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Cada organizaci\u00f3n tiene procesos, objetivos y retos diferentes. Uno de los errores m\u00e1s comunes consiste en implementar un ERP utilizando configuraciones est\u00e1ndar que no reflejan la forma en que realmente opera la empresa.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Un <\/span><b>consultor SAP<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> analiza los procesos existentes, identifica oportunidades de mejora y propone configuraciones alineadas con las necesidades del negocio.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Este enfoque permite que la plataforma apoye la operaci\u00f3n diaria sin generar procesos innecesariamente complejos.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Adem\u00e1s, una correcta parametrizaci\u00f3n desde el inicio facilita futuras expansiones y reduce costos asociados a modificaciones posteriores.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-fbeb8db elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"fbeb8db\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-02e8669\" data-id=\"02e8669\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-345b620 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"345b620\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\"><b>2. Reducir riesgos durante la implementaci\u00f3n<\/b><\/h2><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Toda implementaci\u00f3n tecnol\u00f3gica implica cambios importantes en la operaci\u00f3n.<\/span><\/p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Una mala planificaci\u00f3n puede provocar retrasos, interrupciones del negocio o sobrecostos que afectan el retorno de la inversi\u00f3n.<\/span><\/p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">La experiencia de un consultor especializado permite anticipar posibles riesgos y definir una metodolog\u00eda que considere aspectos como:<\/span><\/p><ul style=\"text-align: left;\"><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Migraci\u00f3n de informaci\u00f3n.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Capacitaci\u00f3n de usuarios.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Validaci\u00f3n de procesos.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Pruebas funcionales.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Puesta en marcha.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Soporte posterior a la implementaci\u00f3n.<\/span><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Gestionar correctamente estas etapas contribuye a que la transici\u00f3n hacia SAP sea m\u00e1s ordenada y controlada.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-820971b\" data-id=\"820971b\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-43b1e93 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"43b1e93\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-41a35b9 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"41a35b9\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-54c48ab\" data-id=\"54c48ab\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1c7abbe elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\" data-id=\"1c7abbe\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"html.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<!-- =========================================================\r\n     EMERSON RUSH \u00b7 OPTIMIZAR PROCESOS Y MEJORAR PRODUCTIVIDAD\r\n     ========================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<section class=\"er-opt-procesos\">\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"er-opt-procesos__header\">\r\n        <span class=\"er-opt-procesos__eyebrow\">\r\n            EFICIENCIA OPERATIVA\r\n        <\/span>\r\n\r\n        <h2>\r\n            3. Optimizar procesos y \r\n            <span>mejorar la productividad<\/span>\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <p>\r\n            El objetivo de SAP no consiste \u00fanicamente en digitalizar procesos, sino en hacerlos m\u00e1s eficientes.\r\n        <\/p>\r\n\r\n        <p>\r\n            Antes de configurar el sistema, un consultor analiza c\u00f3mo fluye la informaci\u00f3n entre las diferentes \u00e1reas de la empresa para identificar actividades repetitivas, cuellos de botella y oportunidades de automatizaci\u00f3n.\r\n        <\/p>\r\n\r\n        <p class=\"er-opt-procesos__intro-list\">\r\n            Como resultado, la organizaci\u00f3n puede obtener beneficios como:\r\n        <\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"er-opt-procesos__grid\">\r\n\r\n        <!-- 01 -->\r\n        <article class=\"er-opt-procesos__card\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"er-opt-procesos__top\">\r\n                <span class=\"er-opt-procesos__number\">01<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"er-opt-procesos__line\"><\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <p class=\"er-opt-procesos__item-text\">\r\n                Menor tiempo en procesos administrativos.\r\n            <\/p>\r\n\r\n        <\/article>\r\n\r\n\r\n        <!-- 02 -->\r\n        <article class=\"er-opt-procesos__card\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"er-opt-procesos__top\">\r\n                <span class=\"er-opt-procesos__number\">02<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"er-opt-procesos__line\"><\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <p class=\"er-opt-procesos__item-text\">\r\n                Informaci\u00f3n centralizada.\r\n            <\/p>\r\n\r\n        <\/article>\r\n\r\n\r\n        <!-- 03 -->\r\n        <article class=\"er-opt-procesos__card\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"er-opt-procesos__top\">\r\n                <span class=\"er-opt-procesos__number\">03<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"er-opt-procesos__line\"><\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <p class=\"er-opt-procesos__item-text\">\r\n                Mejor control de inventarios.\r\n            <\/p>\r\n\r\n        <\/article>\r\n\r\n\r\n        <!-- 04 -->\r\n        <article class=\"er-opt-procesos__card\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"er-opt-procesos__top\">\r\n                <span class=\"er-opt-procesos__number\">04<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"er-opt-procesos__line\"><\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <p class=\"er-opt-procesos__item-text\">\r\n                Mayor visibilidad financiera.\r\n            <\/p>\r\n\r\n        <\/article>\r\n\r\n\r\n        <!-- 05 -->\r\n        <article class=\"er-opt-procesos__card\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"er-opt-procesos__top\">\r\n                <span class=\"er-opt-procesos__number\">05<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"er-opt-procesos__line\"><\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <p class=\"er-opt-procesos__item-text\">\r\n                Procesos estandarizados.\r\n            <\/p>\r\n\r\n        <\/article>\r\n\r\n\r\n        <!-- 06 -->\r\n        <article class=\"er-opt-procesos__card\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"er-opt-procesos__top\">\r\n                <span class=\"er-opt-procesos__number\">06<\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"er-opt-procesos__line\"><\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <p class=\"er-opt-procesos__item-text\">\r\n                Reducci\u00f3n de errores operativos.\r\n            <\/p>\r\n\r\n        <\/article>\r\n\r\n\r\n        <!-- DESTACADO \/ CONCLUSI\u00d3N -->\r\n        <article class=\"er-opt-procesos__card er-opt-procesos__card--featured\">\r\n\r\n            <p>\r\n                Estas mejoras generan un impacto directo en la productividad y en la capacidad de crecimiento de la empresa.\r\n            <\/p>\r\n\r\n        <\/article>\r\n\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n\r\n<style>\r\n\r\n\/* =========================================================\r\n   CONTENEDOR\r\n   ========================================================= *\/\r\n\r\n.er-opt-procesos{\r\n    --er-morado:#5D3271;\r\n    --er-azul:#071C3B;\r\n    --er-naranja:#CD5B56;\r\n    --er-gris:#F3F3F3;\r\n    --er-negro:#111111;\r\n    --er-blanco:#FFFFFF;\r\n\r\n    width:100%;\r\n    padding:65px 0;\r\n    font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\r\n    box-sizing:border-box;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.er-opt-procesos *,\r\n.er-opt-procesos *::before,\r\n.er-opt-procesos *::after{\r\n    box-sizing:border-box;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n\/* =========================================================\r\n   ENCABEZADO\r\n   ========================================================= *\/\r\n\r\n.er-opt-procesos__header{\r\n    max-width:760px;\r\n    margin:0 0 42px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.er-opt-procesos__eyebrow{\r\n    display:block;\r\n    margin-bottom:13px;\r\n\r\n    color:var(--er-naranja);\r\n\r\n    font-size:12px;\r\n    line-height:1.2;\r\n    font-weight:700;\r\n    letter-spacing:2px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.er-opt-procesos__header h2{\r\n    margin:0 0 18px;\r\n\r\n    color:var(--er-azul);\r\n\r\n    font-size:38px;\r\n    line-height:1.15;\r\n    font-weight:700;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.er-opt-procesos__header h2 span{\r\n    color:var(--er-morado);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.er-opt-procesos__header p{\r\n    max-width:650px;\r\n    margin:0 0 12px;\r\n\r\n    color:#555555;\r\n\r\n    font-size:16px;\r\n    line-height:1.75;\r\n    font-weight:400;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.er-opt-procesos__intro-list{\r\n    font-weight: 700 !important;\r\n    color: var(--er-azul) !important;\r\n    margin-top: 15px !important;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n\/* =========================================================\r\n   GRID (3 COLUMNAS EN ESCRITORIO)\r\n   ========================================================= *\/\r\n\r\n.er-opt-procesos__grid{\r\n    display:grid;\r\n    grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 1fr);\r\n    gap:18px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n\/* =========================================================\r\n   TARJETAS\r\n   ========================================================= *\/\r\n\r\n.er-opt-procesos__card{\r\n    grid-column:span 1;\r\n\r\n    position:relative;\r\n\r\n    min-height:180px;\r\n    padding:28px 24px;\r\n\r\n    background:var(--er-gris);\r\n\r\n    border-top:3px solid var(--er-morado);\r\n\r\n    transition:\r\n        transform .25s ease,\r\n        box-shadow .25s ease,\r\n        background .25s ease;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n\/* =========================================================\r\n   N\u00daMERO\r\n   ========================================================= *\/\r\n\r\n.er-opt-procesos__top{\r\n    display:flex;\r\n    align-items:center;\r\n    gap:14px;\r\n\r\n    margin-bottom:20px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.er-opt-procesos__number{\r\n    flex:0 0 auto;\r\n\r\n    color:var(--er-naranja);\r\n\r\n    font-size:13px;\r\n    line-height:1;\r\n    font-weight:700;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.er-opt-procesos__line{\r\n    display:block;\r\n\r\n    width:38px;\r\n    height:1px;\r\n\r\n    background:var(--er-naranja);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n\/* =========================================================\r\n   TEXTOS\r\n   ========================================================= *\/\r\n\r\n.er-opt-procesos__item-text{\r\n    margin:0;\r\n\r\n    color:var(--er-azul);\r\n\r\n    font-size:17px;\r\n    line-height:1.4;\r\n    font-weight:700;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.er-opt-procesos__card p{\r\n    margin:0;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n\/* =========================================================\r\n   TARJETA DESTACADA (ABARCA TODAS LAS COLUMNAS ABAJO)\r\n   ========================================================= *\/\r\n\r\n.er-opt-procesos__card--featured{\r\n    grid-column: 1 \/ -1;\r\n    display:flex;\r\n    align-items:center;\r\n\r\n    background:var(--er-azul);\r\n    border-top-color:var(--er-naranja);\r\n\r\n    min-height:auto;\r\n    padding:26px 28px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.er-opt-procesos__card--featured p{\r\n    color:var(--er-blanco);\r\n    font-size:16px;\r\n    line-height:1.6;\r\n    font-weight:400;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n\/* =========================================================\r\n   HOVER\r\n   ========================================================= *\/\r\n\r\n.er-opt-procesos__card:hover{\r\n    transform:translateY(-5px);\r\n\r\n    box-shadow:\r\n        0 16px 35px rgba(7,28,59,.10);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n\/* =========================================================\r\n   TABLET\r\n   ========================================================= *\/\r\n\r\n@media(max-width:900px){\r\n\r\n    .er-opt-procesos__grid{\r\n        grid-template-columns:repeat(2, 1fr);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .er-opt-procesos__card{\r\n        grid-column:auto;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .er-opt-procesos__card--featured{\r\n        grid-column:1 \/ -1;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n\/* =========================================================\r\n   M\u00d3VIL\r\n   ========================================================= *\/\r\n\r\n@media(max-width:600px){\r\n\r\n    .er-opt-procesos{\r\n        padding:40px 0;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .er-opt-procesos__header{\r\n        margin-bottom:30px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .er-opt-procesos__header h2{\r\n        font-size:29px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .er-opt-procesos__header p{\r\n        font-size:15px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .er-opt-procesos__grid{\r\n        grid-template-columns:1fr;\r\n        gap:14px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .er-opt-procesos__card{\r\n        grid-column:auto;\r\n        min-height:auto;\r\n        padding:24px 20px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .er-opt-procesos__top{\r\n        margin-bottom:15px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n}\r\n\r\n<\/style>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-36b89da elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"36b89da\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-bb0ad1e\" data-id=\"bb0ad1e\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-18679b4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\" data-id=\"18679b4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"html.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<!-- =========================================================\r\n     EMERSON RUSH \u00b7 APROVECHAR MEJOR LA INVERSI\u00d3N EN SAP\r\n     Dise\u00f1o tipo ruta \/ \u00e1reas\r\n     ========================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<section class=\"er-inversion-sap\">\r\n\r\n    <!-- INTRODUCCI\u00d3N -->\r\n    <div class=\"er-inversion-sap__intro\">\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"er-inversion-sap__intro-content\">\r\n\r\n            <span class=\"er-inversion-sap__eyebrow\">\r\n                OPTIMIZACI\u00d3N ERP\r\n            <\/span>\r\n\r\n            <h2>\r\n                4. Aprovechar mejor la \r\n                <span>inversi\u00f3n realizada en SAP<\/span>\r\n            <\/h2>\r\n\r\n            <p>\r\n                Es frecuente que las empresas utilicen \u00fanicamente una parte de las funcionalidades disponibles en su ERP.\r\n            <\/p>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"er-inversion-sap__mensaje\">\r\n                <span><\/span>\r\n                <p>\r\n                    Sin una estrategia adecuada, muchas herramientas relacionadas con reportes, automatizaci\u00f3n, indicadores o an\u00e1lisis permanecen sin utilizarse.\r\n                <\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n\r\n    <!-- =====================================================\r\n         PUNTOS DE VALOR\r\n         ===================================================== -->\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"er-inversion-sap__areas\">\r\n\r\n\r\n        <!-- 01 -->\r\n        <article class=\"er-inversion-sap__area\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"er-inversion-sap__numero\">\r\n                01\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"er-inversion-sap__contenido\">\r\n\r\n                <p>\r\n                    Un consultor SAP ayuda a identificar estas oportunidades y propone mejoras que permiten obtener un mayor valor de la plataforma sin necesidad de realizar inversiones adicionales en otros sistemas.\r\n                <\/p>\r\n\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <\/article>\r\n\r\n\r\n        <!-- 02 -->\r\n        <article class=\"er-inversion-sap__area\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"er-inversion-sap__numero\">\r\n                02\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"er-inversion-sap__contenido\">\r\n\r\n                <p>\r\n                    De esta manera, la empresa aprovecha mejor las capacidades ya disponibles dentro de su entorno SAP.\r\n                <\/p>\r\n\r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <\/article>\r\n\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n\r\n<style>\r\n\r\n\/* =========================================================\r\n   BASE (CLASES AISLADAS: er-inversion-sap)\r\n   ========================================================= *\/\r\n\r\n.er-inversion-sap{\r\n    --morado:#5D3271;\r\n    --azul:#071C3B;\r\n    --naranja:#CD5B56;\r\n    --gris:#F3F3F3;\r\n    --negro:#111111;\r\n    --blanco:#FFFFFF;\r\n\r\n    width:100%;\r\n    padding:65px 0;\r\n\r\n    font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\r\n    box-sizing:border-box;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.er-inversion-sap *,\r\n.er-inversion-sap *::before,\r\n.er-inversion-sap *::after{\r\n    box-sizing:border-box;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n\/* =========================================================\r\n   INTRODUCCI\u00d3N\r\n   ========================================================= *\/\r\n\r\n.er-inversion-sap__intro{\r\n    display:grid;\r\n    grid-template-columns:1fr;\r\n    margin-bottom:48px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.er-inversion-sap__intro-content{\r\n    max-width:800px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.er-inversion-sap__eyebrow{\r\n    display:block;\r\n\r\n    margin-bottom:13px;\r\n\r\n    color:var(--naranja);\r\n\r\n    font-size:12px;\r\n    line-height:1.2;\r\n    font-weight:700;\r\n    letter-spacing:2px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.er-inversion-sap__intro h2{\r\n    max-width:750px;\r\n\r\n    margin:0 0 20px;\r\n\r\n    color:var(--azul);\r\n\r\n    font-size:38px;\r\n    line-height:1.15;\r\n    font-weight:700;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.er-inversion-sap__intro h2 span{\r\n    color:var(--morado);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.er-inversion-sap__intro > div > p{\r\n    max-width:670px;\r\n\r\n    margin:0 0 25px;\r\n\r\n    color:#555555;\r\n\r\n    font-size:15px;\r\n    line-height:1.75;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n\/* MENSAJE DESTACADO *\/\r\n\r\n.er-inversion-sap__mensaje{\r\n    display:flex;\r\n    align-items:stretch;\r\n\r\n    max-width:650px;\r\n\r\n    background:var(--gris);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.er-inversion-sap__mensaje > span{\r\n    display:block;\r\n\r\n    flex:0 0 5px;\r\n\r\n    background:var(--naranja);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.er-inversion-sap__mensaje p{\r\n    margin:0;\r\n    padding:18px 22px;\r\n\r\n    color:var(--azul);\r\n\r\n    font-size:15px;\r\n    line-height:1.6;\r\n    font-weight:600;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n\/* =========================================================\r\n   \u00c1REAS \/ FILAS DE CONTENIDO\r\n   ========================================================= *\/\r\n\r\n.er-inversion-sap__areas{\r\n    width:100%;\r\n\r\n    border-top:1px solid #DDDDDD;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.er-inversion-sap__area{\r\n    position:relative;\r\n\r\n    display:grid;\r\n    grid-template-columns:90px 1fr;\r\n\r\n    padding:30px 15px 30px 0;\r\n\r\n    border-bottom:1px solid #DDDDDD;\r\n\r\n    transition:\r\n        padding .25s ease,\r\n        background .25s ease;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n\/* HOVER *\/\r\n\r\n.er-inversion-sap__area:hover{\r\n    padding-left:20px;\r\n    padding-right:20px;\r\n\r\n    background:var(--gris);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n\/* =========================================================\r\n   N\u00daMEROS\r\n   ========================================================= *\/\r\n\r\n.er-inversion-sap__numero{\r\n    padding-top:3px;\r\n\r\n    color:var(--naranja);\r\n\r\n    font-size:13px;\r\n    line-height:1;\r\n    font-weight:700;\r\n    letter-spacing:1px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n\/* =========================================================\r\n   CONTENIDO\r\n   ========================================================= *\/\r\n\r\n.er-inversion-sap__contenido{\r\n    display:block;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.er-inversion-sap__contenido > p{\r\n    margin:0;\r\n\r\n    color:#555555;\r\n\r\n    font-size:15px;\r\n    line-height:1.75;\r\n    font-weight:400;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n\/* =========================================================\r\n   TABLET\r\n   ========================================================= *\/\r\n\r\n@media(max-width:850px){\r\n\r\n    .er-inversion-sap{\r\n        padding:50px 0;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n\/* =========================================================\r\n   M\u00d3VIL\r\n   ========================================================= *\/\r\n\r\n@media(max-width:600px){\r\n\r\n    .er-inversion-sap{\r\n        padding:40px 0;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .er-inversion-sap__intro{\r\n        margin-bottom:35px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .er-inversion-sap__intro h2{\r\n        font-size:29px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .er-inversion-sap__area{\r\n        grid-template-columns:45px 1fr;\r\n\r\n        padding:25px 0;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .er-inversion-sap__area:hover{\r\n        padding-left:10px;\r\n        padding-right:10px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n}\r\n\r\n<\/style>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-611fa1b elementor-section-height-min-height elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-items-middle\" data-id=\"611fa1b\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-wide\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-24083db\" data-id=\"24083db\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a48547a elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\" data-id=\"a48547a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"html.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<!-- =========================================================\r\n     PREPARAR A LOS EQUIPOS PARA EL CAMBIO\r\n     ========================================================= -->\r\n\r\n<section class=\"sap-preparar-cambio\">\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"sap-preparar-cambio__intro\">\r\n\r\n        <span class=\"sap-preparar-cambio__label\">\r\n            GESTI\u00d3N DEL CAMBIO\r\n        <\/span>\r\n\r\n        <h2>\r\n            5. Preparar a los \r\n            <span>equipos para el cambio<\/span>\r\n        <\/h2>\r\n\r\n        <p>\r\n            La tecnolog\u00eda representa solo una parte del proyecto. El \u00e9xito tambi\u00e9n depende de que las personas comprendan c\u00f3mo utilizar correctamente el sistema.\r\n        <\/p>\r\n\r\n        <p>\r\n            Por ello, un proceso de consultor\u00eda normalmente incluye actividades de acompa\u00f1amiento y capacitaci\u00f3n para los usuarios finales.\r\n        <\/p>\r\n\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"sap-preparar-cambio__grid\">\r\n\r\n\r\n        <!-- PUNTO 01 -->\r\n        <article class=\"sap-preparar-cambio__card\">\r\n\r\n            <span class=\"sap-preparar-cambio__number\">\r\n                01\r\n            <\/span>\r\n\r\n            <h3>Adopci\u00f3n y autonom\u00eda<\/h3>\r\n\r\n            <p>\r\n                Esto facilita la adopci\u00f3n del ERP, disminuye la resistencia al cambio y reduce la dependencia del \u00e1rea de soporte durante las primeras etapas de operaci\u00f3n.\r\n            <\/p>\r\n\r\n        <\/article>\r\n\r\n\r\n        <!-- PUNTO 02 -->\r\n        <article class=\"sap-preparar-cambio__card\">\r\n\r\n            <span class=\"sap-preparar-cambio__number\">\r\n                02\r\n            <\/span>\r\n\r\n            <h3>Impacto y colaboraci\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n            <p>\r\n                Cuando los colaboradores conocen el funcionamiento de SAP y entienden c\u00f3mo impactan sus actividades en otros departamentos, la colaboraci\u00f3n entre \u00e1reas mejora significativamente.\r\n            <\/p>\r\n\r\n        <\/article>\r\n\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n\r\n<style>\r\n\r\n\/* =========================================================\r\n   CONTENEDOR GENERAL (CLASES ISOLADAS: sap-preparar-cambio)\r\n   ========================================================= *\/\r\n\r\n.sap-preparar-cambio{\r\n    --sap-morado:#5D3271;\r\n    --sap-azul:#071C3B;\r\n    --sap-naranja:#CD5B56;\r\n    --sap-blanco:#FFFFFF;\r\n    --sap-gris:#F3F3F3;\r\n    --sap-negro:#111111;\r\n\r\n    width:100%;\r\n    padding:60px 0;\r\n\r\n    font-family:'Raleway', Arial, sans-serif;\r\n\r\n    box-sizing:border-box;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.sap-preparar-cambio *,\r\n.sap-preparar-cambio *::before,\r\n.sap-preparar-cambio *::after{\r\n    box-sizing:border-box;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n\/* =========================================================\r\n   INTRODUCCI\u00d3N\r\n   ========================================================= *\/\r\n\r\n.sap-preparar-cambio__intro{\r\n    max-width:820px;\r\n    margin:0 0 40px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.sap-preparar-cambio__label{\r\n    display:block;\r\n\r\n    margin-bottom:12px;\r\n\r\n    color:var(--sap-naranja);\r\n\r\n    font-family:'Raleway', Arial, sans-serif;\r\n    font-size:12px;\r\n    line-height:1.3;\r\n    font-weight:800;\r\n    letter-spacing:2px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.sap-preparar-cambio__intro h2{\r\n    margin:0 0 18px;\r\n\r\n    color:var(--sap-azul);\r\n\r\n    font-family:'Raleway', Arial, sans-serif;\r\n    font-size:38px;\r\n    line-height:1.18;\r\n    font-weight:800;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.sap-preparar-cambio__intro h2 span{\r\n    color:var(--sap-morado);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.sap-preparar-cambio__intro p{\r\n    max-width:720px;\r\n\r\n    margin:0 0 8px;\r\n\r\n    color:#555555;\r\n\r\n    font-family:'Raleway', Arial, sans-serif;\r\n    font-size:15px;\r\n    line-height:1.75;\r\n    font-weight:400;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n\/* =========================================================\r\n   REJILLA DE DOS COLUMNAS\r\n   ========================================================= *\/\r\n\r\n.sap-preparar-cambio__grid{\r\n    display:grid;\r\n    grid-template-columns:repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));\r\n\r\n    column-gap:30px;\r\n    row-gap:30px;\r\n\r\n    align-items:stretch;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n\/* =========================================================\r\n   TARJETAS\r\n   ========================================================= *\/\r\n\r\n.sap-preparar-cambio__card{\r\n    position:relative;\r\n\r\n    display:flex;\r\n    flex-direction:column;\r\n\r\n    min-height:260px;\r\n\r\n    padding:32px 30px;\r\n\r\n    overflow:hidden;\r\n\r\n    background:var(--sap-azul);\r\n\r\n    border:2px solid var(--sap-blanco);\r\n    border-radius:18px;\r\n\r\n    box-shadow:\r\n        0 12px 30px rgba(7,28,59,.10);\r\n\r\n    transition:\r\n        transform .25s ease,\r\n        box-shadow .25s ease,\r\n        border-color .25s ease;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.sap-preparar-cambio__card::after{\r\n    content:\"\";\r\n\r\n    position:absolute;\r\n    right:-35px;\r\n    bottom:-35px;\r\n\r\n    width:110px;\r\n    height:110px;\r\n\r\n    border:18px solid rgba(255,255,255,.035);\r\n    border-radius:50%;\r\n\r\n    pointer-events:none;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.sap-preparar-cambio__card:hover{\r\n    transform:translateY(-5px);\r\n\r\n    border-color:var(--sap-naranja);\r\n\r\n    box-shadow:\r\n        0 18px 38px rgba(7,28,59,.18);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n\/* =========================================================\r\n   N\u00daMERO\r\n   ========================================================= *\/\r\n\r\n.sap-preparar-cambio__number{\r\n    display:flex;\r\n    align-items:center;\r\n    justify-content:center;\r\n\r\n    width:45px;\r\n    height:45px;\r\n\r\n    margin-bottom:24px;\r\n\r\n    background:var(--sap-morado);\r\n\r\n    border-radius:50%;\r\n\r\n    color:var(--sap-blanco);\r\n\r\n    font-family:'Raleway', Arial, sans-serif;\r\n    font-size:12px;\r\n    line-height:1;\r\n    font-weight:800;\r\n    letter-spacing:1px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n\/* =========================================================\r\n   T\u00cdTULOS\r\n   ========================================================= *\/\r\n\r\n.sap-preparar-cambio__card h3{\r\n    position:relative;\r\n\r\n    margin:0 0 16px;\r\n    padding-left:16px;\r\n\r\n    color:var(--sap-blanco);\r\n\r\n    font-family:'Raleway', Arial, sans-serif;\r\n    font-size:21px;\r\n    line-height:1.35;\r\n    font-weight:800;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.sap-preparar-cambio__card h3::before{\r\n    content:\"\";\r\n\r\n    position:absolute;\r\n    left:0;\r\n    top:4px;\r\n\r\n    width:5px;\r\n    height:calc(100% - 8px);\r\n\r\n    background:var(--sap-naranja);\r\n\r\n    border-radius:5px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n\/* =========================================================\r\n   P\u00c1RRAFOS\r\n   ========================================================= *\/\r\n\r\n.sap-preparar-cambio__card p{\r\n    position:relative;\r\n    z-index:1;\r\n\r\n    margin:0;\r\n\r\n    color:rgba(255,255,255,.82);\r\n\r\n    font-family:'Raleway', Arial, sans-serif;\r\n    font-size:14px;\r\n    line-height:1.75;\r\n    font-weight:400;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n\/* =========================================================\r\n   VARIACI\u00d3N DE TARJETAS (SEGUNDA TARJETA CON COLOR MORADO)\r\n   ========================================================= *\/\r\n\r\n.sap-preparar-cambio__card:nth-child(2)